msgid "The purpose of the evaluation stage is to infer the misstatement θ in the population on the basis of a sample.\n\nThe population consisted of %1$s items and %2$s units. The sample consisted of %3$s sampling units, of which a total of %4$s were misstated. The information from this sample %5$s results in a most likely misstatement in the population of %6$s and a %7$s upper bound of %8$s."
